---
import SectionLayout from '../../layouts/SectionLayout.astro';
---
<SectionLayout
  title="Trial of Character | LASH"
  description="A coming trial to find which figure of the LASH universe your nature answers to."
  theme="trial"
  current="trial"
  eyebrow="Personality Quiz"
  heading="Trial of Character"
  tagline="Every soul in this world was weighed by something. Soon, so will yours be."
  note="Coming Soon"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="empty reveal">
      <strong>The trial is not yet open</strong>
      A set of questions is being prepared. Answer them, and you will be told which figure of
      the age your nature answers to, and what that costs.
    </div>

    <div class="ornament reveal">✦</div>

    <div class="band-head reveal">
      <span class="band-label">In the meantime</span>
      <h2 class="band-title">There is plenty already written</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <a href="/library" class="tile reveal">
        <span class="tile-eyebrow">Short Stories</span>
        <span class="tile-title">Library</span>
        <p class="tile-blurb">Shorter tales, gathered by the age they belong to.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/codex" class="tile reveal">
        <span class="tile-eyebrow">Historical Chronicle</span>
        <span class="tile-title">Codex</span>
        <p class="tile-blurb">Titans, mortals, realms, and relics, recorded age by age.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/gallery" class="tile reveal">
        <span class="tile-eyebrow">Image Gallery</span>
        <span class="tile-title">Hall of Memories</span>
        <p class="tile-blurb">Faces and places of the world, kept where they can be looked at.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</SectionLayout>
